   "text": "SARVAM  saaras  —  cloud, paid, best on a bad line\nVOSK  —  offline, free, 80 MB, runs on the box\n\nSarvam returns 429 or takes over 2 s  →  Vosk answers\nand the call carries on. Measured, not assumed.",
   "originalText": "SARVAM  saaras  —  cloud, paid, best on a bad line\nVOSK  —  offline, free, 80 MB, runs on the box\n\nSarvam returns 429 or takes over 2 s  →  Vosk answers\nand the call carries on. Measured, not assumed.",
