   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "language  →  q0 village  →  CONSENT  →  q1 school  →  q2 family trade  →  q2 years  →  q3 what she earns from\n  →  q4 what she wants to learn  →  q5 how far / any constraint  →  q6 own work or a job  →  q7 local demand\n  →  READ ALL SEVEN BACK  →  recommend\n\nq5 may branch to a guardian check — on decisional capacity, never on disability.\nPRESS # AT ANY TIME  →  a real person calls her back. Nobody is trapped in a menu.",
   "originalText": "language  →  q0 village  →  CONSENT  →  q1 school  →  q2 family trade  →  q2 years  →  q3 what she earns from\n  →  q4 what she wants to learn  →  q5 how far / any constraint  →  q6 own work or a job  →  q7 local demand\n  →  READ ALL SEVEN BACK  →  recommend\n\nq5 may branch to a guardian check — on decisional capacity, never on disability.\nPRESS # AT ANY TIME  →  a real person calls her back. Nobody is trapped in a menu.",
