   "text": "Her schooling and her years of work, against the\nNSQF entry table. Three answers, always:\n\nELIGIBLE        she can enrol today\nNEAR-MISS      with the exact gap —\n                     'one more year', or 'do Level 2 first'\nINELIGIBLE     and why\n\n881 expired courses are never ranked.",
