   "text": "'You have done twelve years of weaving. For this\ncourse you do not need a school certificate.'\n\n· the three options, one plain sentence each\n· the near-miss and exactly what would close it\n· PM-DAKSH instead, if that fits her better\n· ₹50,000 help if she starts her own work\n· what to do on Monday, and where\n· press 9 to hear it again, any time",
